## Summary of Modifications to Vendored Upstream Files

Per Apache-2.0 Section 4(b), prominent modification notices have been added to the
three modified upstream files under `vendor/dsh-video-storyboard/src/storyboard/`:

1. `src/storyboard/ytdlp.js`:
   Added host-selective `NO_PROXY` bypass for Bilibili domestic domains
   (`.bilibili.com`, `.b23.tv`, `.bilivideo.com`, `.bilivideo.cn`, `.hdslb.com`)
   with automatic `--proxy ""` fallback on proxy, SSL, timeout, or HTTP 567 errors.
2. `src/storyboard/fetch.js`:
   Surfaced real `downloadError` before audio-only fallback checks, guarded
   `ffmpegAbs` null values before `path.isAbsolute(ffmpegAbs)`, and added a
   single browser UA/Referer retry (`--sleep-requests 1`) on transient HTTP
   403/412/429/567 responses in both `probeSummary()` and `fetchMedia()`.
3. `src/storyboard/asr.js`:
   Added `DSH_ASR_FALLBACK_CONFIG` as a lowest-priority fallback config candidate
   after `$DSH_HOME/asr.json` and `~/.dsh/asr.json` so bundled local ASR runtimes
   activate automatically when no user `asr.json` is configured.
